{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering","id":1094232,"title":"[2E] Gathra & Social Manuvering","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-18T11:19:14-07:00","id":1094232,"title":"[2E] Gathra & Social Manuvering","content":"To not resurrect ancient dead previous topics...<br /> <br /> I prepare interactions with spirits for my players. As I understand rules, spirit NEED to get Gathra first, before any real interaction with it can be made. What kind of Gathra can spirit demand? Actions fulfilling it's Ban? Classical 'you bring me a virgin'? Other Gathra ideas?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T11:42:17-07:00","id":1094245,"title":"","content":"In my interpretation, Gathra is just the name for any Soft Leverage offered to a spirit. Services and sacrifices would likely be acceptable Soft Leverage to a spirit, as might offerings of Essence be. The Supplication Rite is a great one as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-18T18:36:19-07:00","id":1094375,"title":"","content":"Offering Essence, preferably Resonant with the spirit. Creating circumstances which Resonate with the spirit, or eliminating circumstances that work against the spirit's Resonance. Getting rid of possible banes and ban sources in the vicinity. Sabotaging the spirit's rivals or predators. Punishing the spirit's subordinates that betrayed it. A window of free time in which the spirit may Manifest freely and affect the world of Flesh.<br /> <br /> Really, in the end it's all about Resonance and Essence, but there are many ways to get to that final goal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T02:45:03-07:00","id":1094475,"title":"","content":"My characters prefers hard leverage. &quot;You do this for me, and I don't bind you into this rock for the next thousand years.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T04:36:46-07:00","id":1094485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094475#post1094475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My characters prefers hard leverage. &quot;You do this for me, and I don't bind you into this rock for the next thousand years.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah! Sounds like an Ithaeur Bone Shadow, or possibly Storm Lord.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T10:00:02-07:00","id":1094601,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seidmadr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094485#post1094485\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah! Sounds like an Ithaeur Bone Shadow, or possibly Storm Lord.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bingo on the later one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T12:26:59-07:00","id":1094642,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094475#post1094475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My characters prefers hard leverage. &amp;quot;You do this for me, and I don't bind you into this rock for the next thousand years.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>But spirits are literally metaphysically incapable of making deals without receiving Gathra first. You have to give them some Essence <i>and then</i> threaten them, or else you'll just end up with a lot of rocks with spirits bound to them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T12:53:17-07:00","id":1094652,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094642#post1094642\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But spirits are literally metaphysically incapable of making deals without receiving Gathra first. You have to give them some Essence <i>and then</i> threaten them, or else you'll just end up with a lot of rocks with spirits bound to them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think so. The core says that a few essence points is the minimum gathra without using hard leverage, implying that you can get them lower if you wanted to.<br /> <br /> I'm not terribly keen on it myself. I mean, spirits are so hardwired to this system that you have to use gathra, you can't persaude them to help you... Unless you're threatening them in which case the Spirits suddenly has freewill. That feels like it undermines the weird psychology of spirits a bit.<br /> <br /> I dunno, I can kinda see a justification maybe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T15:13:21-07:00","id":1094694,"title":"","content":"Oh yeah. Weird.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T20:23:03-07:00","id":1094765,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094652#post1094652\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't think so. The core says that a few essence points is the minimum gathra without using hard leverage, implying that you can get them lower if you wanted to.</div> </div> </div> </div>Two points of Essence is the bare minimum to convince a Rank 1 spirit to do something through the diplomatic channels represented by Social Maneuvering without Hard Leverage. Stronger and more hostile spirits explicitly require a higher tithe, and framing a negative task* as a favor doesn't make it gathra any more than saying you won't rob me makes me grateful to you for my having dinner that night.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:11px\">* Saying you won't do something that's bad for me gives me nothing I wouldn't get by going underground and/or having you murdered in your sleep. Giving me a mildly expensive trinket and insinuating that I won't be in a position to receive such a nice present again if I don't do this thing you want me to do, <i>if you catch my drift</i>, etc, is closer to the proper vein of spiritual extortion than &quot;I know the Fetish Rite and you have something I want.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I'm not terribly keen on it myself. I mean, spirits are so hardwired to this system that you have to use gathra, you can't persaude them to help you... Unless you're threatening them in which case the Spirits suddenly has freewill. That feels like it undermines the weird psychology of spirits a bit. </div> </div> </div>The spirit doesn't &quot;suddenly have free will&quot; when you're threatening them \u2014 you literally cannot apply Hard Leverage and Force Doors until you've made at least a minimal offer thanks to spirits being ephemeral bundles of compulsions who never do anything for free.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T22:08:52-07:00","id":1094779,"title":"","content":"On game session went with Gathra as trening to resolve spirits Ban - If it was worded as 'he need to do something at least once in this time'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T22:40:16-07:00","id":1094780,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094779#post1094779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On game session went with Gathra as trening to resolve spirits Ban - If it was worded as 'he need to do something at least once in this time'.</div> </div> </div> </div>But if the spirit's ban is indeed worded as &quot;The spirit needs to (do something)&quot; like you say, then I don't think someone else doing it wouldn't count. Helping the spirit fulfill its ban will still count, so I guess there's not much difference, but still.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-19T23:31:24-07:00","id":1094786,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094780#post1094780\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But if the spirit's ban is indeed worded as &quot;The spirit needs to (do something)&quot; like you say, then I don't think someone else doing it wouldn't count. Helping the spirit fulfill its ban will still count, so I guess there's not much difference, but still.</div> </div> </div> </div>In this particular instance we talked about <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1080206-2e-hunting-grounds-uppsala-sweden?p=1092924#post1092924\">Gefjun as spirit</a>. In my write up, she has Ban as:<br /> <br /> <i>'Need to have sacrificed 'virginity' at least once per season. 'Virgin' may be killed, or just lose virginity in Lake M\u00e4laren area.'</i><br /> <br /> So one of PCs going to her for lose of his virginity was counted as Gathra.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T00:46:33-07:00","id":1094795,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094786#post1094786\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In this particular instance we talked about <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1080206-2e-hunting-grounds-uppsala-sweden?p=1092924#post1092924\">Gefjun as spirit</a>. In my write up, she has Ban as:<br /> <br /> <i>'Need to have sacrificed 'virginity' at least once per season. 'Virgin' may be killed, or just lose virginity in Lake M\u00e4laren area.'</i><br /> <br /> So one of PCs going to her for lose of his virginity was counted as Gathra.</div> </div> </div> </div>A ban is something the spirit has must or must not do under the right conditions. Nothing about the one you've got for Gefjun serves as a compulsion that can be invoked to &quot;put an end to whatever [she] is trying to do.&quot;<br /> <br /> Your statblock gives her Possession (and not Fetter, oddly enough). She's a bodyjacking spirit with an agenda \u2014 that suggests a much more direct pattern of activity than contriving sacrifices.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T01:14:58-07:00","id":1094797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094786#post1094786\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In this particular instance we talked about <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1080206-2e-hunting-grounds-uppsala-sweden?p=1092924#post1092924\">Gefjun as spirit</a>. In my write up, she has Ban as:<br /> <br /> <i>'Need to have sacrificed 'virginity' at least once per season. 'Virgin' may be killed, or just lose virginity in Lake M\u00e4laren area.'</i><br /> <br /> So one of PCs going to her for lose of his virginity was counted as Gathra.</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, that sounds more like an Aspiration (and the Gathra being helping the spirit fulfill it) than a ban. A ban is something that impacts the spirit negatively. Is that Gefjun a real-life figure that exists somewhere in legends and myths?<br /> <br /> EDIT: Silly me, should've searched it for myself. Turns out she's a pretty major deity! After a cursory reading on Wikipedia, I suggest she is a Rank 3-4 spirit with &quot;Can only Manifest in an area that has been ploughed by a woman&quot; as a ban, and &quot;A plough owned by a farmer whose land yielded no bounty this year&quot; as a bane. Not sure why Gefjun would be taking virgin sacrifices, though, since she looks more like a guardian of women and feminine power in agriculture.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":12619,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","user":"21C Hermit","date":". 05-20-2017, 04:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T01:28:45-07:00","id":1094803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094765#post1094765\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The spirit doesn't &quot;suddenly have free will&quot; when you're threatening them \u2014 you literally cannot apply Hard Leverage and Force Doors until you've made at least a minimal offer thanks to spirits being ephemeral bundles of compulsions who never do anything for free.</div> </div> </div> </div>My point is that soft leverage is exclusively gathra, you don't roll. It implies a level of inflexibility in Spirits, it doesn't matter how great an argument you make, the price is still the same. However, hard leverage introduces the possibility that there is actually a degree of flexibility in what the Spirit requires.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T02:47:15-07:00","id":1094819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094797#post1094797\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not sure why Gefjun would be taking virgin sacrifices, though, since she looks more like a guardian of women and feminine power in agriculture.</div> </div> </div> </div>In this take, it's Elemental spirit only stealing some of her Myths from mortals, and as stories are centered on virgins, she used them to feed herself. She do not <i>need</i> to kill virgins, she devours 'virginity'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T02:48:36-07:00","id":1094820,"title":"","content":"Practical question my players asked to me - <b>If Ban is not suitable Gathra, how character is about to guess what would be good Gathra for each particular spirit?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T03:08:47-07:00","id":1094823,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094820#post1094820\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Practical question my players asked to me - <b>If Ban is not suitable Gathra, how character is about to guess what would be good Gathra for each particular spirit?</b></div> </div> </div> </div>Asking them what they want?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T03:49:08-07:00","id":1094827,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seidmadr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094823#post1094823\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Asking them what they want?</div> </div> </div> </div>So each time prepare list of Aspirations for each spirit asked for directions in Hisil? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T04:35:09-07:00","id":1094833,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094827#post1094827\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So each time prepare list of Aspirations for each spirit asked for directions in Hisil? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>If it's something that simple, just give them a drop of Essence and threaten them with a beating if they don't comply.<br /> <br /> I thought we were talking more serious things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T04:39:38-07:00","id":1094834,"title":"","content":"So spirit!Gefjun is Resonant with virginity? That... doesn't sound like an elemental spirit, but that probably isn't the issue here.<br /> <br /> Every spirit wants survival. Survival can be divided into 1) adherence to the spirit's ban, 2) avoidance of its bane, and 3) Essence. Since bans and banes are central to ephemeral beings, you should have at least a vague idea of each spirit's ban and bane. For &quot;standard&quot; or &quot;random encounter&quot; spirits found in the Hisil, don't bother writing individual bans and banes for them. Treat them as a category, which is what Werewolf 2E core does <i>anyway</i>. If you see a tree spirit, for example, there's a good chance it wants you to do something like tend to a specific tree, plant new trees in the grove, protect the local trees from lumberjacks, bury a carcass in the forest to serve as fertilizer, or chase away the lingering fire spirits born from the forest fire last year. You can guess such actions pretty easily when you know what type of spirit you are looking at. And all such actions are related to its ban, bane, or Resonance and thus important to the spirit. If all else, you can just offer a lump of Essence. The aforementioned tree spirits would be fond of Essence that is Resonant with trees, water, sunlight, soil and such.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T08:56:05-07:00","id":1094877,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094803#post1094803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My point is that soft leverage is exclusively gathra, you don't roll. It implies a level of inflexibility in Spirits, it doesn't matter how great an argument you make, the price is still the same.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's Spiritual Negotiation 101 \u2014 these aren't strictly people you're dealing with. Part of the benefit of using Social Maneuvering to represent the process is that you don't need to use an argument to get a spirit to do what you want it to do.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> However, hard leverage introduces the possibility that there is actually a degree of flexibility in what the Spirit requires. </div> </div> </div>What the spirit <i>requires</i> is any payment at all \u2014 nothing about the mechanics necessitates that the price a spirit demands be the bare minimum and the fact that hostility directly raises the price a spirit will demand from you is kind of a huge sign that the terms set for an exchange in a relationship modeled through a system that revolves around the maneuvered party trusting the maneuvering party are not the same as the bottom line of spirits needing to be offered a positive gain of some sort to expend their own resources.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T12:26:05-07:00","id":1094914,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094642#post1094642\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But spirits are literally metaphysically incapable of making deals without receiving Gathra first. You have to give them some Essence <i>and then</i> threaten them, or else you'll just end up with a lot of rocks with spirits bound to them.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not a deal. There's nothing nice about what I'm doing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T17:07:01-07:00","id":1094972,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094914#post1094914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's not a deal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then it's not even Hard Leverage and it has nothing to do with this thread.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T17:45:01-07:00","id":1094978,"title":"","content":"So, from corebook text, you cannot even start discussion with spirits without Gathra, right? And beside 2 Essence, it should be action in the Flesh for particular spirits? So what - I go to Hisil to find spirit A, meet spirit B- to getting from spirit B even location of A, I need to go out of Hisil, do Gathra of B, come back to Hisil and THEN asked spirit B for directors? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-21-2017, 03:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T19:49:59-07:00","id":1094996,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094978#post1094978\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, from corebook text, you cannot even start discussiom with spirits without Gathra, right?</div> </div> </div> </div>That is not what anything means.<br /> <br /> Gathra is required to get spirits to <i>do things for you without the use of magical compulsion</i>, but plain conversation is generally a matter of talking and listening and remembering that you're dealing with a bunch of monomaniacs and their slightly more rounded superiors.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And beside 2 Essence, it should be action in the Flesh for particular spirits? </div> </div> </div>2 Essence or an equivalent item from the listing is enough to serve as Soft Leverage for a Rank 1 spirit; spirits that are more powerful and/or more hostile need correspondingly larger tribute to consider doing you a favor.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> So what - I go to Hisil to find spirit A, meet spirit B- to getting from spirit B even location of A, I need to go out of Hisil, do Gathra of B, come back to Hisil and THEN asked spirit B for directors? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> </div> </div> </div>If you have no social resources to your name, sure, but the default unit of werewolf society is the pack for a reason.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-20T21:59:01-07:00","id":1095021,"title":"","content":"When the rules seem overbearing, just remember that the spirit of the rules (puns not intended) is Give And Take- you give the spirit something, after which you take something from it. As long as that's upheld, your table should be able to smooth and gloss over the small details. <br /> <br /> (Of course the best situation is to perfectly understand both the spirit and letter of every rule in the book, but that isn't always the case)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-21T00:34:08-07:00","id":1095043,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1095021#post1095021\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When the rules seem overbearing, just remember that the spirit of the rules (puns not intended) is Give And Take- you give the spirit something, after which you take something from it. As long as that's upheld, your table should be able to smooth and gloss over the small details.</div> </div> </div> </div>So my PCs giving seaweed to Water Spirit should work for something simple as asking for directions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-21T00:40:13-07:00","id":1095044,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1095043#post1095043\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So my PCs giving seaweed to Water Spirit should work for something simple as asking for directions?</div> </div> </div> </div>1) Is the water spirit of the sea? (That is, is seaweed Resonant with the spirit?)<br /> 2) Is seaweed somehow related to the spirit's ban, bane, or Aspiration? (You need not tell that such is so or not to your players, unless one of them uses some power to assess the spirit)<br /> 3) Is the water spirit part of the journey, rather than its end? (That is, is the spirit unimportant enough to not warrant a minor quest specifically to deal with it?)<br /> <br /> If yes to the above, then by all means do so. (Although I have a hunch that sacrificing animals or offerings of food would work well with many spirits of the water, rivers, and sea, considering all the real-life lore behind such beings)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T02:19:15-07:00","id":1095412,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1094972#post1094972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then it's not even Hard Leverage and it has nothing to do with this thread.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hard Leverage can and is encourage to be applied whilst Forcing Doors. If you name a spirit your sacred prey, you're honoring it, even if the honor is akin to being the main course in a cannibalistic entrance dish. <i>Ni Daha</i> Is a thing.<br /> <br /> My character's rite even includes creating an artistic representation of the spirit. It's way above a perfunctory gift.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12191,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","user":"Malus","date":". 05-22-2017, 05:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-22T11:54:33-07:00","id":1095583,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1094232-2e-gathra-social-manuvering?p=1095412#post1095412\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hard Leverage can and is encourage to be applied whilst Forcing Doors.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hard Leverage <i>can only be </i>applied whilst Forcing Doors and you explicitly can't even roll for Social Maneuvering to open a spirit's Doors without giving it <i>something</i>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you name a spirit your sacred prey, you're honoring it, even if the honor is akin to being the main course in a cannibalistic entrance dish. <i>Ni Daha</i> Is a thing. </div> </div> </div>And <i>Ni Daha</i> doesn't elevate a spirit's relative status in the courts or put Essence in its belly.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> My character's rite even includes creating an artistic representation of the spirit. It's way above a perfunctory gift. </div> </div> </div>I'm going to go out on a limb here and guess that the spirit is not seeing any &quot;benefit&quot; out of that artistic representation being used as a targeting symbol in a rite to empower werewolves to hunt it down, particularly if it's not immediately present when you're conducting the rite.<br /> <br /> Methods of compelling spirits to do things exist that aren't socially oriented. They aren't what the topic is about.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T04:39:30-07:00","id":1095839,"title":"","content":"If I show the spirit the focus of the rite to name a hunt over it and ask it to decide if it would keep it or if I should dedicate it to my Firstborn, the tangible benefit it gets is that it gets to keep on trucking as usual. And that can be a perfunctory gift too. Of course if the spirit can't recognize itself in the representation, the artwork wouldn't work in the rite itself. The gift given doesn't needs to benefit the spirit, it needs to be accepted only. Few thing make it surer than to going &quot;Take this or you'll cease to be&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}